OL,3,GNEWSAStudents face being 'turned away
OL,4,Afrom college' over budget gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of students could be "turned
OL,7,Faway from college" if changes are not
OL,8,Fmade to the Welsh government's draft
OL,9,Fbudget, according to further education
OL,10,Fleaders.
OL,12,FThey warn it will lead to a "dire
OL,13,Fsituation" after a major UK-wide report
OL,14,Fhighlighted the problem of young people
OL,15,Fnot in education employment or training
OL,16,F(NEET).
OL,18,FFinance Minister Elin Jones has set out
OL,19,Fspending plans for 2027-28 which
OL,20,Fincluded #851m for Medr settlement
OL,21,Fwhich would mean cuts to further
OL,22,Feducation, College Wales said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
